<title>MALAYSIA: Sanda requests share suspension.</title>
<headline>Sanda requests share suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian plastics maker Sanda Plastics Industries Bhd said in a statement on Wednesday it plans to suspend its shares from trading on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange from 9.30 a.m. on May 29.</p>
<p>No reason was given for the request, and company officials could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>Sanda shares closed 1.40 ringgit higher at 12.60 ringgit on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
